    "VISUAL_NAME": "Card",
    "SCHEMA_NAME": "FAM_TOTAL_GROSS_ASSET_VALUE",
    "SCHEMA_DESCR": "VIS_001 — Total Gross Asset Value KPI card with sparkline, for the Asset/Finance Manager Management Dashboard. Assumption (data availability): no cost/value column exists on FAM_ASSET_REGISTER or anywhere else in the currently deployed schema (FAM_ASSET_REGISTER carries only ASSET_CODE/ASSET_NAME/CAPITALIZATION_DATE, and is itself not yet physically deployed in this preview database, unlike FAM_ASSET_INSTALLATION which is deployed) — so this card uses COUNT of assets with a CONFIRMED FAM_ASSET_INSTALLATION record as an interim volume proxy for 'gross asset value', trended by installation month. Once FAM_ASSET_REGISTER is deployed with a PURCHASE_COST/TOTAL_CAPITALIZED_COST column, GROSS_ASSET_VALUE should be swapped to SUM(TOTAL_CAPITALIZED_COST) joined by ASSET_CODE, keeping the same period trend and branch filter shape. Assumption (FY criterion): FINANCIAL_YEAR is resolved via the server-side system tokens ?.@1stDayOfFinYear/?.@Today (Apr-Mar), always defaulting to the current FY with no staleness risk; it is not exposed as an editable per-tile prompt here — the parent Management Dashboard's own criteria panel is the place to add an overridable FY selector shared across all its tiles. Assumption (branch default): 'logged-in user's branch, selectable All' is implemented as an optional 'like' filter defaulting to '%' (All) with an F2 lookup to FAM_BRANCH_MASTER; wiring the true logged-in-user's-branch default requires a project variable (:user_site or similar) that was not confirmed to exist in this project. Branch is resolved per asset from its latest APPROVED FAM_ASSET_TRANSFER (no branch/location column exists on the asset itself). Drill-through: this card has no explicit target per the FRS; when placed on the dashboard it renders as a static KPI tile.",
    "SCHEMA_TYPE": "S",
    "OUTPUT_TYPE": "JSON",
    "DATABASE_TYPE": "1",
    "DATABASE_DETAIL": { "DATABASE_NAME": "PostgreSQL", "TYPE": 1 }
